# A consumer imports only the statics it uses. Importing the rest would not
# merely be wasteful: a static's signature is unerased, so it has to be
# expressible in the consumer's own type space, and one it never calls need not
# be. `Top` is reconstructed only as `Sub`'s ancestor — a root that carries no
# usage record — so nothing registered the five-parameter closure struct its
# statics name, and reaching either of them is a compiler panic. The arity has
# to be one no other closure in the program shares, since closure types are
# keyed by arity and void-ness alone.
# name          dir    deps          root
@test/zchk      lib    -
main            app    @test/zchk    root
